# LICENSE_SIGNING_KEY is the public dev pair: LICENSE_PUBLIC_KEYS[1] in @awaketab/core trusts it only in sandbox
# builds (PUBLIC_POLAR_SERVER unset or sandbox). Production uses a key from `pnpm keys:prod` (LAUNCH-AUDIT N-03).
# PUBLIC_POLAR_SERVER is read by the build (checkout links, dev key) and by the Functions (Polar API base).
# INDEXNOW_KEY (optional, build variable, not needed locally) makes `pnpm build` write dist/{key}.txt (F-05).
